Noun, Verb, Adjective, adverb

At the start of the entire game, each player will be given 3 nouns and 3 adjectives- pull three more nouns from deck once run out of nouns, and 3 more adjectives once run out of adjectives.

All players start off with 3 forge templates
__noun__ 
__adj__ 
 __adj__ __noun__ 

players can buy forge templates from a shop using coins they earned after everyone has fight once

